  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://agnipathvayu.cdac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Indian Air Force (Bhartiya Vayu Sena)</a></span> has released Enrolment List for the Airforce Agniveer Vayu Intake 02/2026 Recruitment 2025 (Intake 02/2026) on the official website of IAF. Applications for the Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu 02/2026 Recruitment 2025 were accepted from July 11, 2025, to August 04, 2025. The Phase II examination <span data-teams=\"true\"> was held on January 2026.</span> Candidates who had applied this form can download their Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu 02/2026 Enrolment List from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Indian Air Force (Bhartiya Vayu Sena), Central Armed Selection Board</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu Intake 02/2026 Enrolment List</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>11 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>11 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>04 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date Edit Application Form : <strong>12-13 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>25 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City :<strong> 15 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card :<strong> 24 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result :&nbsp;<strong>06 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Phase-II Exam Date : <strong>January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Phase-II Admit Card&nbsp;:<strong> 09 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Phase-II (2nd Batch) Admit Card :<strong> 09 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PSL List :<strong> 18 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Enrolment List : <strong>05 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 550/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs. 550/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu Intake Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<b>17.5 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21</strong><b>&nbsp;Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates born between&nbsp;<strong>2 July 2005 and 2 January 2009</strong>&nbsp;(including both dates) are&nbsp;<strong>eligible</strong>&nbsp;for the Recruitment Rally.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu Intake 02/2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Posts : 2500 Post (Approx.)</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 48px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Airforece Agniveer Vayu (Intake 02/2026)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2500 Post (Approx.)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu Intake Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>10+2 (Intermediate):</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must have passed with&nbsp;<strong>Mathematics</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Physics</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong>English</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum&nbsp;<strong>50% aggregate marks</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>50% in English</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Diploma in Engineering:</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3-year Diploma in&nbsp;<strong>Mechanical</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Electrical</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Electronics</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Automobile</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Computer Science</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Instrumentation Technology</strong>, or&nbsp;<strong>IT</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum&nbsp;<strong>50% aggregate marks</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>50% in English</strong>&nbsp;in the diploma course.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Vocational Course:</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2-year vocational course with&nbsp;<strong>Physics</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Mathematics</strong>&nbsp;as non-vocational subjects.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum&nbsp;<strong>50% aggregate marks</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>50% in English</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check/Download Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu 02/2026 Enrolment List</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Enrolment List link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new page will be opened in which candidates have to provide Roll Number / Application Number &amp; DOB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the Enrolment List &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the Enrolment List also from the official website of Indian Air Force, CASB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Indian Airforce Agniveer Vayu Intake Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Physical Fitness Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Adaptability Test I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Adaptability Test II</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Merit List</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</